et mein ek batsman bina run banaye out ho gaya. Uska score kya hoga?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... zero?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, bina run ke score zero hai. Ab board par 6 aur 9 dekho. Dono mein kya fark hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... 6 mein gol niche hai... 9 mein gol upar hai"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Tumne gol ki jagah batayi: 6 mein neeche, 9 mein upar. Ab Bholu ne 6 ulta likha aur bola, yeh ab bhi chhah hai. Kya woh sahi hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"nahi... woh 9 ban gaya na"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, ulta 6 ab 9 ban gaya. Ab number naam ki baari. Nau ka numeral kya hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"9"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, nau ka numeral 9 hai. Ab main bolungi eight. Tum ungliyon se eight dikhaoge?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... haan... ungli se... aise..."},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, tum ungliyan dikha rahe ho. Phone par main tumhari ungliyan dekh nahi sakti. Tumne kitni ungliyan dikhayi hain?"},{"who":"child","text":"aath... umm... aath ungliyan"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Tumne kaha aath ungliyan. Main phone par dekh nahi sakti, par tumhari baat sun li. Maan lo ghar ka number 7 hai. Uske liye kitni taaliyan bajaoge?"},{"who":"child","text":"saat... umm... saat taaliyan"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, 7 ke liye saat taaliyan. Ab ulta gino: teen, do, ek. Phir kya aayega?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero... zero aayega"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Tumne zero kaha. Ab chidiya wali baat socho. Taar par teen chidiya thi; teeno udd gayin. Kitni bachi?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, teeno chidiya udd gayin, toh zero bachi. Zero ka matlab koi bhi nahi bacha. Aaj ke liye yahin rukhein?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... game khelein?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Game nahi bana sakti. Chalo, bolkar ek chhoti paheli khelte hain. Main bolun paanch, tum kaunsa numeral bologe?"}],"usage":{"usd":0.07508,"tokens":48535},"boards":4,"lastMs":5520,"screen":{"on":"nothing","texts":[],"words":"the board is empty"},"learne